    }
  },"decision":{
    "summary":"The investigation board contains two unsupported or partially supported condition nodes that conflate absence of evidence with causal failure. Node-12diii6 is observationally true but lacks procedural linkage; node-1ka5agi correctly remains unknown due to missing direct records.","evidenceUsed":["7e69d300-c57e-40a8-bb37-35a61073ff33#1","da0260c0-7d49-43e8-b074-da2a14c7d59c#1"],"unknowns":["Whether valve-by-valve briefing was required or given.","Whether a change drawing review was mandated and performed."],"alternatives":["Treat node-12diii6 as observationally supported but not causally established until procedural requirement is proven absent.", "Keep node-1ka5agi as unknown pending retrieval of any missing work-package cover sheet that might note briefing status."],"confidence":0.85
  }
